<title>UK: Thames Water agrees design, contract sale.</title>
<headline>Thames Water agrees design, contract sale.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thames Water Plc said on Wednesday it has agreed to sell a substantial part of its design and contracting business to Black and Veatch, based in Kansas City, Missouri, USA.</p>
<p>Financial details were not disclosed but the company said the amount involved falls within the 65 million stg provision for restructuring announced earlier this year.</p>
